{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25785","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 肥河维舟阻冻袛待勅命 二 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 肥河维舟阻冻袛待勅命 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮阳效理空多病，疎受辞荣岂恋班。\n陈力不任趋北阙，有家无处寄东山。\n疲骖岂念前程税，倦鸟安能待暮还。\n珍重八公山下叟，不劳重泪更追攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}